      "title": "Watch for verdict changes"
     },
     "description": "Register identifiers for notification when their verdict changes. The transition that matters is phantom to squat: a name models invent that somebody then registers.\n\nUse this for a dependency that came back `absent` or `phantom` and that the user intends to use anyway, or for a set of dependencies worth monitoring. Delivered by signed webhook to a URL you supply.",
     "inputSchema": {
